        </g>
        <circle cx="16" cy="25" r="1" fill="url(#wifiRadialC)" opacity="0.8"/>
      </svg>`,
        "🏊‍♂️": `<svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" width="32" height="32">
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="poolGradC" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
            <stop offset="0%" style="stop-color:#80d4ff;stop-opacity:1" />
            <stop offset="100%" style="stop-color:#39b9fc;stop-opacity:1" />
          </linearGradient>
          <radialGradient id="bubbleGradC">
            <stop offset="0%" style="stop-color:#ffffff;stop-opacity:0.8" />
